== Strategy ==

* Scientist Toilet will frequently stun units, so repair drones are recommended to unstun your higher damage units.
* As it appears on the final wave, you should have almost everything maxed out and have enough money for your DPS units.
* You should sell your farms on the last wave because they will not make any more money unless you sell them.
* It is also quite fast for its health, so you could use [[Green Laser Cameraman]] to slow it down, letting you do slightly more DPS.
* This unit was previously the most powerful boss.

